egory_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"-UEeCTgxud4OGWshX4x-jw","review_id":"HUVrMY7I3dpHMPlwOunysA","date":"2017-04-18T11:53:51","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9500188827514648,"text_excerpt":"The coffee and the cream, oh yes! This place has a gorgeous aesthetic, it's completely instagram worthy, and well worth the stop. They have your standard affogato with the basic neutral cream ice cream and a strong espresso, but I also love how many other options they have including unique flavors such as earl gray and bananas foster. I just had to get the affogato flight, which features 4 versions of their affogato. My only complaint with this is that you can't do a \"build your own\" and choose the ice creams and shots you want, but rather they have a set list. The girl preparing the flight on the day I went in was really sweet and did allow me to change one of the flavors, but I don't th..."},{"business_id":"-UEeCTgxud4OGWshX4x-jw","review_id":"SLFkcdUryMmObfkz5Q-3CA","date":"2020-11-09T22:31:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9445919990539551,"text_excerpt":"I finally got the chance to visit Drip Affogato Bar. I have wanted to try the ice cream flights for a while. The barista says the shop primarily has heavy tourist traffic, but locals do enjoy it. I tried the Signature Affogato Flight with a sampling of Tiramisu, Cookie Monster, Bananas Foster, and Vietnamese coffee. I must say, the cookie monster was the kid's favorite, and I adored the Tiramisu. Talk about a WINNING WEEKEND! This place is perfect for a date night or a night or a day with the kids. I did bring some home to my kids, and they really enjoyed testing the different flavors."},{"business_id":"-UEeCTgxud4OGWshX4x-jw","review_id":"vuZT1SEe5ja7btFz0umSgA","date":"2019-07-20T22:57:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9418617486953735,"text_excerpt":"This place is trendy and unique! I found myself here one evening when exploring the Central Business District. They are open until 10pm, so it was perfect! I've heard of affogato before, but I had never been to a place that specializes in it! They have about 5 'speciality' affogato desserts that have a scoop of ice cream, toppings, and a shot of coffee/hot chocolate/tea. I tried the matcha one, and it had a scoop of green ice cream, a green tea pocket stick, and coconut flakes. If affogato isn't quite your thing, you can also order plain ice cream or coffee. Aside from the food/drink, the space is clean and modern. Honestly, the shop feels brand new! The staff was so nice and friendly. I ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"-UEeCTgxud4OGWshX4x-jw","photo_id":"xhB7Pb8pCYyvRGa4SfRM-g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/xhB7Pb8pCYyvRGa4SfRM-g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8631852865219116},{"business_id":"-UEeCTgxud4OGWshX4x-jw","photo_id":"907yPHkKKN1qqeBw8oHpOQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/907yPHkKKN1qqeBw8oHpOQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8581480979919434},{"business_id":"-UEeCTgxud4OGWshX4x-jw","photo_id":"7cUMCPyX-QryQVpAdsS2Og","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7cUMCPyX-QryQVpAdsS2Og.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8336344361305237},{"business_id":"-UEeCTgxud4OGWshX4x-jw","photo_id":"TWFtKViaPAzmhEOazL6Vsw","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/TWFtKViaPAzmhEOazL6Vsw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7492232918739319},{"business_id":"-UEeCTgxud4OGWshX4x-jw","photo_id":"1IR1I7myyEcrYftjOd-lsw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1IR1I7myyEcrYftjOd-lsw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.6790646314620972}]},"notebook_case":null}
